+% Title label for sources without author/responsibility >>>3
+% ABNT NBR 10520:2023, 6.1.1.4: use the sole word of a one-word title;
+% otherwise use the first word followed by [...]. If the title begins with a
+% common article/monosyllabic function word, retain the following word too.
+% Users can set shorttitle to override the automatic abbreviation for edge cases.
+\ExplSyntaxOn
+\seq_new:N \l__abnt_citetitle_words_seq
+\tl_new:N \l__abnt_citetitle_main_tl
+\tl_new:N \l__abnt_citetitle_first_tl
+\tl_new:N \l__abnt_citetitle_first_lower_tl
+\clist_const:Nn \c__abnt_citetitle_leads_clist
